	(text "Minimal power distribution board, 20 x 10 mm, two M2 holes.\n- J1 BATTERY: wire pads, 1 = BAT+, 2 = GND.\n- J2 SWITCH: an off-board SPST switch in series with battery +. 1 = BAT+, 2 = VOUT. Rate it for the full load current.\n- J3 LOAD: wire pads, 1 = VOUT (switched battery +), 2 = GND.\n- Pads 2.9 x 3.6 mm suit wires up to ~16 AWG. Copper path sized for ~5 A on 1 oz copper (see CLAUDE.md)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 50.8 101.6 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
